  "_meta": {
    "managed_by": "dxdfir_stack",
    "source": "elastic/templates/component/logs-dxdfir@windowlicker.json",
    "description": "The windowlicker lane model: the fields its GoDFIR submodules (goevtx, gomft, goese, goamcache, goappcompat, goprefetch, gowxt, gosbe, gore, gole, gojle, gorb) write. The tools' own time columns are pinned as dates (ignore_malformed, so an epoch-zero sentinel never fails the record) and the goevtx winlog.* projection lives in the shared logs-dxdfir@winlog model. goese.table is the ESE table alias; AppId is the SRUM integer (gojle's object AppId is moved to jumplist.app by the submodule before it can collide); Payload and EnvVars are the long raw strings kept as match_only_text. daemonhunter, the other GoDFIR lane, carries its own logs-dxdfir@daemonhunter model."
  }
